# Panorama's singletons, declared so they resolve the same way whether this
# tree is the `qs -p` config root (Panorama standalone) or a folder loaded from
# outside it (the Omarchy shell plugin). Without this file the plugin case
# silently hands every import site its own instance -- see
# spikes/plugin-imports.sh.
singleton Apply 1.0 Apply.qml
singleton Brightness 1.0 Brightness.qml
singleton Draft 1.0 Draft.qml
singleton Edid 1.0 Edid.qml
singleton Globals 1.0 Globals.qml
singleton Hypr 1.0 Hypr.qml
singleton Lifecycle 1.0 Lifecycle.qml
singleton Persist 1.0 Persist.qml
singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml
